# ============================================================================
#  CRITICAL: Never commit API keys, secrets, or the key-pool database.
#  The tool stores plaintext Tavily API keys in `tavily_keys.db` by design
#  (for fast SQLite-backed round-robin with zero startup cost). If you ever
#  accidentally `git add` it, the keys are still in your local git history —
#  rotate every key in the pool immediately.
# ============================================================================

# --- Key pool database (PLAIN-TEXT API KEYS) ---
# All three files are SQLite WAL-mode artifacts of the same database; the
# `-shm` and `-wal` files can also contain recently-written key rows.
tavily_keys.db
tavily_keys.db-shm
tavily_keys.db-wal
*.keys.db

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# --- Virtualenv (rebuilt by users with their own Python) ---
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Editor / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local environment / one-off migration scripts ---
.env
.env.local
migration_test.py
*.log